# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Arc Lightning assigns a fixed total of three damage across two legal creature targets.
# Forcing: Both opposing creatures must receive damage, so the cast reaches the divided-allocation prompt.
# AI behavior: The human acts in Main1 and the opponent has no decisions before resolution.
# Failure modes:
#   WIN = both allocations were accepted and both opposing creatures died.
#   LOSE = the spell failed to resolve through the requested allocation.
#   TIMEOUT = the distribution prompt was not answered or did not resume Forge.
# Card roles:
#   Arc Lightning — produces the fixed-total DistributionReq.
#   Coral Merfolk — receives one damage and survives only if allocation is wrong.
#   Savannah Lions — receives two damage and survives only if allocation is wrong.
# Protocol path: ActionsAvailableReq -> SelectTargetsReq -> DistributionReq -> TargetSpec update -> resolution.
[metadata]
Name:Distribution Arc Lightning
Goal:Win
Turns:1
Difficulty:Tutorial
Description:Divide Arc Lightning's three damage across two creatures and resolve both assignments.

[state]
